n><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e272cfe8553473c0\" href=\"?note=e272cfe8553473c0\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-free-formula\">17-df-quantifier-free-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3eb5325f08c84582\" href=\"?note=3eb5325f08c84582\" title=\"17-df-symbols\">17-df-symbols</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification_history","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.3; 3.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Exercise 1.3.5; Exercise 3.1.8; local fixed-variable syntax and open-formula extension"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>34</span><span>146</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>50</span><span>162</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"existential/universal-existential sentence definitions compared in supplied OCR; local open-formula extension disclosed"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span> 为固定语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\">\\(v_i\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a> 的固定变量序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExForm}_{L,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExForm}_{L,n}\\)</span> 的指标。各集合定义中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>、以及全称—存在片段中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 均由相应量词局部绑定。序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle v_i:i&lt;n\\rangle\">\\(\\langle v_i:i&lt;n\\rangle\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle v_{n+j}:j&lt;m\\rangle\">\\(\\langle v_{n+j}:j&lt;m\\rangle\\)</span> 的坐标互异，两个块互不相交。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeVar}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e272cfe8553473c0\" href=\"?note=e272cfe8553473c0\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-free-formula\">17-df-quantifier-free-formula</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{All}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{All}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Exists}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Exists}_L\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3eb5325f08c84582\" href=\"?note=3eb5325f08c84582\" title=\"17-df-symbols\">17-df-symbols</a> 的量词块函数，包括空序列输入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExForm}_{L,n},\\mathrm{ExSent}_L,\\mathrm{ForallExistsSent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{ExForm}_{L,n},\\mathrm{ExSent}_L,\\mathrm{ForallExistsSent}_L\\)</span> 在下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ExForm}_{L,n}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L:\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\theta)\\subseteq\n\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\cup\\{v_{n+j}:j&lt;m\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{36mm}\\land\\varphi=\n\\operatorname{Exists}_L(\\langle v_{n+j}:j&lt;m\\rangle,\\theta)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExSent}_L\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ExForm}_{L,0}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_L,\\\\\n\\mathrm{ForallExistsSent}_L\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:\n\\exists n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}\\sigma=\n\\operatorname{All}_L\\bigl(\\langle v_i:i&lt;n\\rangle,\n\\operatorname{Exists}_L(\\langle v_{n+j}:j&lt;m\\rangle,\\theta)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ExForm}_{L,n}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L:\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\theta)\\subseteq\n\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\cup\\{v_{n+j}:j&lt;m\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{36mm}\\land\\varphi=\n\\operatorname{Exists}_L(\\langle v_{n+j}:j&lt;m\\rangle,\\theta)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExSent}_L\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ExForm}_{L,0}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_L,\\\\\n\\mathrm{ForallExistsSent}_L\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:\n\\exists n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}\\sigma=\n\\operatorname{All}_L\\bigl(\\langle v_i:i&lt;n\\rangle,\n\\operatorname{Exists}_L(\\langle v_{n+j}:j&lt;m\\rangle,\\theta)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>空量词块由上游函数在空序列上的定义处理。因此无量词句子属于两个句子片段；存在公式的自由变量只能来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\">\\(\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>原书允许任意变量名的前束量词块；本地使用固定且互异的变量前缀。无捕获改名给出逻辑等价代表；本地集合是规范语法片段，不能把不同变量拼写的公式编码直接视为相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-quantifier-free-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e272cfe8553473c0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-quantifier-free-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-symbols","status":"resolved","id":"3eb5325f08c84582","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-symbols]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$ 为固定语言，$v_i$ 为 [[17-df-first-order-language]] 的固定变量序列；$n\\in\\omega$ 是 $\\mathrm{ExForm}_{L,n}$ 的指标。各集合定义中的 $m$、以及全称—存在片段中的 $n$ 均由相应量词局部绑定。序列 $\\langle v_i:i<n\\rangle$ 和 $\\langle v_{n+j}:j<m\\rangle$ 的坐标互异，两个块互不相交。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FreeVar}$、$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$、$\\mathrm{QFForm}_L$ 分别见 [[17-df-free-variable]]、[[17-df-sentence]]、[[17-df-quantifier-free-formula]]。$\\operatorname{All}_L$、$\\operatornam